# nixos-config

- Target `#nixos` (user `surya`) unless asked. Rebuild command is `nh os switch` from this repo — do not run it or reboot unless asked.
- Do not commit unless asked. Do not write git config.
- Never store MS/Citrix usernames, passwords, Wi-Fi PSKs, or API keys in the flake.
- Do not spawn `bluetoothctl` from Serpantinum/bar scripts. Keep Bluetooth A2DP-only (no HFP autoswitch).
- Hyprland is Lua (`modules/hyprland/lua/`). Serpantinum is patched in `modules/desktop/serpantinum.nix`, not forked.
- New modules must be declared as `flake.modules.*` **and** imported from the host file. Defining a file is not enough.
- Read `.cursor/skills/nixos-config/SKILL.md` when editing Nix, Hyprland, audio, boot, or the bar.
